    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀηδ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nauseousness</i>, of drugs, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unpleasantness</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.163
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				p.64J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly of persons,
				<i>unpleasantness, odiousness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.153
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				20.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν σὴν ἀ.</span> your
				<i>odious presence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.164
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>disgust, dislike</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				240d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
