				802d
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ βαρύτητες τῶν ἄλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.31
				</span></i>
			.</div>
